      "refersTo": "task-row",
      "description": "The selected row and its aligned due/priority margin.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-row\"><label class=\"ds-check\"><input type=\"checkbox\" aria-label=\"Complete task\"/><span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"13\" height=\"13\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"3\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m20 6-11 11-5-5\"/></svg></span></label><div><button class=\"ds-title\" type=\"button\">Review sync conflict behavior</button><span class=\"ds-tags\">sync</span></div><span class=\"ds-due\">Today</span><span class=\"ds-priority\">High</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-row{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;display:grid;grid-template-columns:24px minmax(0,1fr) 87px 86px;column-gap:12px;align-items:start;min-height:86px;padding:17px;max-width:760px;background:#e6f3f0;outline:1px solid var(--teal,#148078);outline-offset:-1px;color:var(--ink,#173e53)}.ds-check{position:relative;width:20px;height:24px;margin-top:3px;display:inline-grid;place-items:center;cursor:pointer}.ds-check input{position:absolute;inset:0;margin:0;width:20px;height:24px;opacity:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-check>span{display:grid;place-items:center;width:18px;height:18px;border:1.5px solid #9cb2bd;border-radius:4px;background:#fff;pointer-events:none}.ds-check svg{opacity:0;color:#fff}.ds-check input:checked+span{background:var(--teal,#148078);border-color:var(--teal,#148078)}.ds-check input:checked+span svg{opacity:1}.ds-check input:focus-visible+span{outline:3px solid var(--teal,#148078);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-title{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;display:block;font-size:16px;line-height:1.45;font-weight:560;color:#12685f;background:transparent;border:0;border-radius:2px;padding:0;text-align:left;overflow-wrap:anywhere;cursor:pointer}.ds-title:hover{text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:4px;text-decoration-thickness:1px}.ds-title:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal,#148078);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-tags{display:block;margin-top:8px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.4;color:#356d69;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-due,.ds-priority{padding-top:2px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:650;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums;overflow-wrap:anywhere}.ds-priority{color:#9a442e}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-check,.ds-due,.ds-priority,.ds-row,.ds-tags,.ds-title{animation-duration:.001ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.001ms!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Conflict Version",
      "kind": "card",
      "refersTo": "conflict-version",
      "description": "A flat comparison surface for preserved conflicting content.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-version\"><span class=\"ds-version-label\">Version 1<time>15 Oct, 14:30</time></span><p>Review the revised notes.</p><button class=\"ds-version-action\" type=\"button\">Use this version</button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-version{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;background:var(--ground,#f3f6f8);color:var(--ink,#173e53);border-radius:5px;padding:12px;max-width:360px}.ds-version-label{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;gap:10px;color:var(--muted,#526b78);font-size:11px;font-weight:600;line-height:1.5}.ds-version-label time{font-weight:400;font-variant-numeric:tabular-nums}.ds-version p{white-space:pre-wrap;overflow-wrap:anywhere;margin:9px 0 12px;font-size:13px;line-height:1.5;max-height:200px;overflow:auto}.ds-version-action{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;font-size:12px;line-height:1.5;background:transparent;border:0;color:#126b64;text-decoration:underline;text-underline-offset:3px;padding:0;cursor:pointer}.ds-version-action:hover{color:#0b504b;text-decoration-thickness:2px}.ds-version-action:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal,#148078);outline-offset:3px;}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-version,.ds-version-action,.ds-version-label{animation-duration:.001ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.001ms!important}}"
    },
    {
      "name": "Sync Disclosure",
      "kind": "button",
      "refersTo": "sync-control",
      "description": "Compact persistence status anchored in the ink-blue dock.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-sync-dock\"><button class=\"ds-sync\" type=\"button\" aria-expanded=\"false\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M6 3v12M18 9a6 6 0 0 1-6 6H6\"/><circle cx=\"18\" cy=\"6\" r=\"3\"/><circle cx=\"6\" cy=\"18\" r=\"3\"/></svg><span>Saved on this machine</span><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"m6 9 6 6 6-6\"/></svg></button></div>",
      "css": ".ds-sync-dock{background:var(--ink,#173e53);padding:13px 20px 17px;width:240px}.ds-sync{font-family:-apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", sans-serif;display:flex;gap:8px;align-items:center;justify-content:flex-start;width:100%;min-height:39px;background:#234d62;border:1px solid #43677a;border-radius:6px;padding:10px;color:#e3f1f2;font-size:11px;line-height:1.4;text-align:left;cursor:pointer;transition:background-color .14s}.ds-sync>span{flex:1}.ds-sync>svg{flex:none}.ds-sync>svg:first-child{color:#a4d9cd}.ds-sync:hover{background:#2a596f}.ds-sync:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--teal,#148078);outline-offset:3px;}.ds-sync>svg:last-child{transition:transform .18s}.ds-sync[aria-expanded=true]>svg:last-child{transform:rotate(180deg)}@media(prefers-reduced-motion:reduce){.ds-sync,.ds-sync-dock{animation-duration:.001ms!important;animation-iteration-count:1!important;transition-duration:.001ms!important}}"
    }
  ],
  "narrative": {
    "northStar": "Margin notes",
    "overview": "Margin notes gives everyday task work the calm order of a technical-book margin grid. Ink-blue navigation anchors a cool working ground, while white task rows and an adjacent white editor keep the content readable and directly editable. The repeated metadata margin is the signature; the interface does not simulate paper or book ornament.\n\nThe density is compact and practical. One system UI sans family, restrained curves, light rules, and small helper copy support quick capture and sustained editing. “Tasks” is the current interface label; this document does not establish a final product name. The system uses vector interface icons and requires no raster imagery.",
    "keyCharacteristics": [
      "Ink-blue navigation and cool neutral working surfaces.",
      "A teal action and selection language.",
      "Aligned task metadata with wrapping titles and tags.",
      "Compact system typography with explicit local-save and sync feedback.",
      "Responsive list-to-details navigation with a persistent sync disclosure."
    ],
    "rules": [
      {
        "name": "The Teal State Rule",
        "body": "Use teal to identify primary actions, completion, selection edges, and keyboard focus. Use warm warning colors only for an actual warning, error, overdue date, or high-priority state.",
        "section": "colors"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Metadata Margin Rule",
        "body": "Align due dates and priority to shared columns across the task list. When width contracts, compress or stack that margin before sacrificing readable task content.",
        "section": "layout"
      },
      {
        "name": "The Quiet Surface Rule",
        "body": "Keep the rail, working ground, task list, and editor flat. Use soft elevation for the synchronization disclosure and Undo feedback.",
        "section": "elevation"
      }
    ],
    "dos": [
      "Do use the same ink-blue, cool ground, white surfaces, and teal state roles on adjacent screens.",
      "Do keep task titles, due dates, and priority aligned to a stable margin grid; let long text wrap.",
      "Do preserve visible focus, readable labels, and a reachable sync disclosure at every supported width.",
      "Do describe local saving and GitHub synchronization as separate states using plain, small helper copy.",
      "Do use the full-width details view with Back at the established narrow-screen breakpoint."
    ],
    "donts": [
      "Don't add physical-book ornament to the Margin notes grid.",
      "Don't introduce a separate display face or promotional type treatment into the task workspace.",
      "Don't use shadows to lift ordinary task rows or the editor.",
      "Don't turn the plain-text tag line into decorative chips without an approved system change.",
      "Don't encode selection, completion, errors, or sync outcomes through color alone."
    ]
  }
}
